{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Shut the windows and don't look outside",
    "steam_appid": 3527020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527020/extras/767159d0022ed7e8272c76cffa540739.avif?t=1745236103\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, trapped in your own home, waiting for &quot;help&quot; to arrive. To make it through the night, you must keep your fear in check and ensure no unwelcome presence lingers for too long. Every second in the dark brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home is your only refuge, but the power supply is limited. You must carefully ration your energy, deciding which rooms to keep lit and which to let fall into darkness. Every flicker of light could mean the difference between safety and exposure. Run out of fuel, and you may not get another chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows keep opening\u2026 but did you forget to close them, or is something else inside with you? Keep them shut at all costs. If you let them stay open too long, you might see something you were never meant to. And whatever happens\u2014<strong>do not look outside.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear is more than a feeling\u2014it\u2019s an invitation. If you let the terror take hold, <i>It</i> will take notice. Things that shouldn\u2019t be there begin to manifest. If you see them, make them disappear quickly. <strong>Do not stare. Do not hesitate.</strong> If you let them stay, you may not be able to tell what\u2019s real anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>A critical notice from the Bureau of Liberty and Individual Safety (B.L.I.S.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recent disturbances and abnormal phenomena have been detected in your area. For your safety and well-being, all individuals must remain inside their homes. Under no circumstances should you look outside. Keep all doors locked and windows shut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT LOOK OUTSIDE. DO NOT GO OUTSIDE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some citizens have reported symptoms due to extended isolation, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry mouth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurred Vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irregular heart rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevated blood pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sightings of Angels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These symptoms are normal and will worsen if instructions are not followed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To minimize these symptoms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a well-lit environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure all windows remain shut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid visual contact with the outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid visual contact with the Angels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B.L.I.S. thanks you for your cooperation. Re-read this message carefully.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527020/extras/767159d0022ed7e8272c76cffa540739.avif?t=1745236103\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, trapped in your own home, waiting for &quot;help&quot; to arrive. To make it through the night, you must keep your fear in check and ensure no unwelcome presence lingers for too long. Every second in the dark brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home is your only refuge, but the power supply is limited. You must carefully ration your energy, deciding which rooms to keep lit and which to let fall into darkness. Every flicker of light could mean the difference between safety and exposure. Run out of fuel, and you may not get another chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows keep opening\u2026 but did you forget to close them, or is something else inside with you? Keep them shut at all costs. If you let them stay open too long, you might see something you were never meant to. And whatever happens\u2014<strong>do not look outside.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear is more than a feeling\u2014it\u2019s an invitation. If you let the terror take hold, <i>It</i> will take notice. Things that shouldn\u2019t be there begin to manifest. If you see them, make them disappear quickly. <strong>Do not stare. Do not hesitate.</strong> If you let them stay, you may not be able to tell what\u2019s real anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>A critical notice from the Bureau of Liberty and Individual Safety (B.L.I.S.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recent disturbances and abnormal phenomena have been detected in your area. For your safety and well-being, all individuals must remain inside their homes. Under no circumstances should you look outside. Keep all doors locked and windows shut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT LOOK OUTSIDE. DO NOT GO OUTSIDE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some citizens have reported symptoms due to extended isolation, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry mouth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurred Vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irregular heart rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevated blood pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sightings of Angels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These symptoms are normal and will worsen if instructions are not followed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To minimize these symptoms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a well-lit environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure all windows remain shut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid visual contact with the outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid visual contact with the Angels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B.L.I.S. thanks you for your cooperation. Re-read this message carefully.</p>",
    "short_description": "The respective authorities are hard at work to restore normal life for your loved ones. In the meantime, B.L.I.S. strongly urges you to keep your windows shut and do not look outside.",
